        <li><strong>Charlotte is growing beyond banking.</strong> Ally Financial, Lincoln Financial, and Brighthouse Financial (MetLife spin-off) have created diversification beyond the Big Three banks. Insurance, FinTech, and financial technology are growing in Charlotte alongside the traditional banking sector.</li>
